{"title":"1987 USAMO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is the smallest set of polynomials <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/5/2751d79d3bbfb34440d68c685fe6ba7414951749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> such that: \n</p>\n<dl><dd>1. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/9/a092977b152423d3b8edc9c6d8fb4bed0e70f44d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x) = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"70\" height=\"20\" /> belongs to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />.</dd>\n<dd>2. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/5/c05cbeb1cf4b5153e365a9253baefde1c97135e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> belongs to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/f/e2fb08aedacb622dfa9854bbba718af231e3d29a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\cdot r(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/7/6b7055b6b8e7b3a88cb58568fc7f732231d8dabe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x + (1 - x) \\cdot r(x) )$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"147\" height=\"18\" /> both belong to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />.</dd></dl>\n<p>Show that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/5/c05cbeb1cf4b5153e365a9253baefde1c97135e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/0/9703e10f151c26e976f124951c28a2dac5f1884d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> are distinct elements of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/5/705a2b12c1d119452c80de72dc0f4a65899628f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r(x) \\neq s(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" /> for any <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/f/e4f17e1346c7c9bb4f51a1dc76b4e547a9da487c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; x &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/0/9703e10f151c26e976f124951c28a2dac5f1884d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> be an arbitrary polynomial in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/f/87fa832bf21ebc48a46289cd7aea73ffcc84c111.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X.$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/3/433537c813b503e9f97290cfb60009a700137f2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;s(x)&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"18\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/2/2b25d33821cc59e9d8a4a0b9bdb419f623203485.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;x&lt;1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" /> Define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/b/4db762b9ec2f5ed80d0696b57e842c27f22256e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_1=\\{s(x)\\in X:s(x)=x\\cdot s_1(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"262\" height=\"18\" /> for some <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/5/19513bad6292a00782565c0726bbe8c85d5ea0c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_1(x)\\in X\\},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/c/cac7ce19b43cca1a9b936d8e55aeb99dfc5cc1c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_2=\\{t(x)\\in X: t(x)=x+(1-x)t_1(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"321\" height=\"18\" /> for some <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/2/1f2d112f214f7235d7b05f914246cc91ee7b95a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_1(x)\\in X\\}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/f/47f86ee40d1390bcecfe8075eb95c26da7a1a89d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s(x) \\in X_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/4/534bb7f0102a8a79f837d6ce9bd96f4654c2be8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t(x)\\in X_2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"18\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/9/6d9da3e2c1fbd4385fa66682beaf02d337cf4277.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s(x) &lt;x&lt;t(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/2/2b25d33821cc59e9d8a4a0b9bdb419f623203485.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;x&lt;1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" /> Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/d/9adf5f7aa06e2e33a9925a5666fa3abcd05a3e14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s(x)\\ne t(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"87\" height=\"18\" /> for any <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/2/2b25d33821cc59e9d8a4a0b9bdb419f623203485.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;x&lt;1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>For any <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/d/8fda76d60c6742d6b749e74405dd8465bca3a68d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s(x), t(x) \\in X_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"18\" />, Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/c/9bcac955ae25b0b2b621b834c9c8c19a22371d6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s(x)=x\\cdot s_1(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/a/a6a127657aff1cf2a99154fe83e87034c896c31e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t(x)=x\\cdot t_1(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"119\" height=\"20\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/9/ee9bdba3fd30bb7d12366d27ffcb93afd1064bed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_1(x), t_1(x) \\in X.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"128\" height=\"18\" /> If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/7/8e78d56845f0f3d7a39035eb30c56fbf9f47c19f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_1(x) \\ne t_1(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/a/31a57231256f17ca1ad593f930bfb798351565e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;x&lt;1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"81\" height=\"16\" /> then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6e14e85f9d43a5fc92639f3d1181277bcb669dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s(x)-t(x)=x(s_1(x)-t_1(x))\\ne 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"269\" height=\"18\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/2/2b25d33821cc59e9d8a4a0b9bdb419f623203485.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;x&lt;1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Similarly, for any <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/8/7586f90bf222bb367a6379e46973ee6645124e44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s(x), t(x) \\in X_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"18\" />, Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/d/bfd9456aedccdc74bebeafe98b6c2cd3bf42bde0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s(x)=x+(1-x) s_1(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"184\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/0/270cea73d89b7017d705476a716918035c631cbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t(x)=x+(1-x) t_1(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"181\" height=\"18\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/9/ee9bdba3fd30bb7d12366d27ffcb93afd1064bed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_1(x), t_1(x) \\in X.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"128\" height=\"18\" /> If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/7/8e78d56845f0f3d7a39035eb30c56fbf9f47c19f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_1(x) \\ne t_1(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/a/31a57231256f17ca1ad593f930bfb798351565e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;x&lt;1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"81\" height=\"16\" /> then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/5/c356fdd540be3c70e7031a699cd63dbe9dac1f8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s(x)-t(x)=(1-x)(s_1(x)-t_1(x))\\ne 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"314\" height=\"18\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/2/2b25d33821cc59e9d8a4a0b9bdb419f623203485.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;x&lt;1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>The proof is done by an induction.\n</p><p>J.Z.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO\" title=\"1987 USAMO\">1987 USAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"1987 USAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1987 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 USAMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1987 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1987 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"USAMO Problems and Solutions\"> All USAMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017180531\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.066 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 267/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1267/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8234/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.143      1 -total\n 56.56%    6.868      1 Template:USAMO_box\n 40.75%    4.948      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:15083:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017180531 and revision id 94617. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}